{"kind":"request","text":"H3-mac: the Mac mini host kit. Child of request e6a5cd22 (launchd and\nHTTPS validation findings), slice H3 of the self-hosting note\n(notes/2026-10-19-self-hosting-on-celld.md section 9) for one macOS node.\nTakes the slot after the item in progress under decision 03d1ac0e and\norder 1ea188be. No Worker change; no kernel change.\n\nScope: a kit under apps/room/celld/mac/ that installs and removes\nSeaweedFS, celld and Caddy as LaunchDaemons running as one user, and\nthe documents that let a person deploy with it. The validation of\n27 October (evidence ~/play/artroom-evidence/2026-10-27-mac-launchd-https,\nREPORT.md) is the source of every setting below; the kit records the\nvalue and the reason, not the history.\n\n1. Units and scripts. install.sh and uninstall.sh (run with sudo by\n   the operator), three launchd plists, and a `down` script that stops\n   celld first and SeaweedFS after celld has exited, so the store\n   outlives celld and the handoff completes (item 4 of e6a5cd22).\n   Settings that held: KeepAlive; run as the user; ExitTimeOut 60;\n   ThrottleInterval 70 for celld, above its 60 s lease; celld starts\n   only after a PUT to the store succeeds; SeaweedFS filer fsync rule,\n   master election timeout 1 s, explicit volume max; CELLD_TTL_MS\n   60000. Caddy: grace_period 10s; one certificate; header_up\n   CF-Connecting-IP {remote_host}; the served Caddyfile of the\n   validation as the template.\n2. Certificate. A script that makes a self-signed certificate macOS\n   accepts: EC P-256, serverAuth EKU, at most 825 days, SAN names and\n   addresses. The script refuses a lifetime over 825 days. The user\n   trust steps from REPORT.md go in the document, marked as tested on\n   macOS with a bypass flag and not tested on Firefox, iOS or with\n   real browser trust.\n3. Documents. A new section of docs/self-host.md, \"Run on a Mac\", in\n   the order a person follows: prerequisites, install, certificate and\n   trust, first room, maintenance (authenticated restart with\n   `fdesetup authrestart` because FileVault is on), stop and remove.\n   User-supplied certificate and tunnel as documented alternatives, one\n   paragraph each. docs/celld.md links to it. Plain English, prose lines\n   at most 79 characters, no comparisons, no product names beyond the\n   naming rule.\n4. Witnesses, on the Mac mini behind Caddy, each as one scenario\n   stating one invariant: (a) install from a clean state and a first\n   room created by the CLI; (b) `down` stops celld before SeaweedFS and\n   celld's log shows a completed handoff; (c) a kill -9 of celld under\n   KeepAlive comes back serving with no acknowledged act lost (count the\n   entries); (d) the certificate script's output is accepted by the\n   system trust check and a 900-day request is refused; (e) MCP agent\n   creation over HTTPS through the proxy is admitted (PUBLIC_ORIGIN from\n   H1). Evidence per docs/testing.md and ruling 4e199bd8; keys,\n   certificates and secrets withheld and named.\n\nDone when the four parts are on main with the five witnesses.\nConditions: one head on main; gate once at the sent head; implementation\nnote and manifest per docs/testing.md and ruling 4e199bd8; exact-head\nchecker review; AGENTS.md writing rule for the documents; the\ndap.validate.* daemons of the validation are removed before the kit's\ninstall witness runs and the removal is recorded.","body":{"conditions":"One head on main; gate once at the sent head; note and manifest per docs/testing.md and ruling 4e199bd8; exact-head checker review; witnesses (a)-(e) on the Mac mini behind Caddy; validation daemons removed first; no Worker or kernel change.","stale_bases":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:03d1ac0e23b4ac92fbe5e3da268358c021f7cab9 stale; retired bases: git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:46f9d0f1944ead2f3d94c4be1267c73a4bdec1a1","target_head":"41da9810f0c2d8727b07c129b2d47149107993e7","target_ref":"refs/heads/main","target_repo":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3","to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}